def unresolved_reason(row: int) -> str:
    prefix = {
        2: "A likely 1911 teacher namesake was rejected because no OSS, rank, location, or protected-identifier bridge was found. ",
        6: "A postwar Washington aerial-photography lead was rejected as temporally insufficient and unbridged to OSS. ",
        11: "A Library of Congress finding-aid name lead for Dana De Peyster Whipple Jr. does not establish that it is this indexed person or any pre-OSS affiliation. ",
        14: "Lawrence Lafayette Whisonant, the singer Lawrence Winters, remains an unassigned namesake because no source bridges him to this initial-less OSS row. ",
        42: "A Harvard finding-aid family reference to Frederic L. P. White supplies no OSS or employment bridge and was rejected as insufficient. ",
    }.get(row, "")
    return prefix + ("Exact-name and meaningful-variant searches across the NARA index context, CIA Reading Room, Library of Congress, OSS, employment, occupation, obituary, institutional, newspaper, directory, and archival sources produced no reliable identity and pre-OSS affiliation bridge; unbridged namesakes were rejected.")


